    88	
    89	    ``O_CREAT | O_EXCL`` before pytest is spawned is what makes the evidence this
    90	    invocation's own: a file left by an earlier run -- or planted by someone who wants a
    91	    passing receipt without a run -- is refused instead of reused or overwritten.
